The files in this directory that carry the SPDX identifier
"GPL-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause" come from the Linux rtw89 driver
(torvalds/linux tag v6.6, drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw89).
EmberBSD uses them under the BSD-3-Clause terms below.

The NetBSD glue and the Linux API emulation (if_rtw89.c, rtw89_bridge.c,
rtw89_compat.c, rtw89_compat.h, rtw89_nb.h and compat/) carry their own
2-clause BSD licence in each file.

